# Overrides for the citizen shell (/citizen) of the internet zone. Copy to .env (git-ignored).
# Wins over apps/internet/.env; list only what differs from the zone. Server-side only
# (docs/configuration.md). Precedence: real environment > this file > zone .env > defaults.

# Backend of /citizen/api for this shell
# API_UPSTREAM=
# Sign-in BFF behind /citizen/auth
# AUTH_UPSTREAM=
